      "writtenOn": "2022-07-13T20:53:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "why do we do this? We pass in baseOutputFileName to this function then set it to itself. If we\u0027re going to allow the client to set different file names can\u0027t we just set the baseOutputFileName where we get the client input before we call into this function?\n\nAnd where ever the above is happening, wouldn\u0027t we know the whole filepath/name at that point? Could we just save the entire thing instead of 3 separate strings?",
